  "fixes": [
    "BFCL SDK does not retry an uncertain persistent generation; every engine attempt has a stable rid.",
    "Timeout cleanup verifies exact rid/session and awaits scheduler terminal state and session release; unknown cleanup remains infrastructure failure.",
    "A weak live-request registry prevents a late completion from recreating closed session tracking.",
    "BFCL task refill uses a new episode_instance_id; no full-history reset or retry within a failed attempt.",
    "Explicit generation_timeout is available for persistent cells; the absent-field default remains 600 seconds.",
    "One user-simulator-only transport retry preserves the original error; agent generation, tool execution, cap errors and cancellation are not retried.",
    "Final structured assistant tool calls survive prompt processing; raw schema span resolution follows the same final-message handling.",
    "A grouped tool-result history boundary excludes only synthetic EOS/whitespace whose preceding tokens exactly match the full prompt."
  ],
